{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": -200,
   "width": 4580,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "# Ingest a folder of papers, overseen by tier 0 for the Owner (to-be)\n**Symptom:** In the as-is run control came back to tier 0 six times on the happy path (graded bad), and every failure was resolved by tier 0 by hand.\n**Root cause:** The ingestion is not a workflow the Core runs; failures have no owner below tier 0; completion has no judge apart from the worker.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `ingestion-tobe.spec.yaml`."
  },
  {
   "id": "s",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "\u25cf start",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**1.** directs the ingestion of a folder into a library, naming the subfolders to exclude"
  },
  {
   "id": "a2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**2.** hands the ingestion to a Lead and sets the oracle's specification: UC1's success guarantee"
  },
  {
   "id": "a3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**3.** opens an ingest-folder run for the folder"
  },
  {
   "id": "a4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**4.** surveys the folder and proposes a decision per subfolder"
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 1140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 every other root current?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 1340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**5.** applies the Owner's exclusions and the decisions policy allows"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 1340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: resolves the stale root (remedy R1)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 Clerk qualified in this Core?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "xe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "takes over the escalated case"
  },
  {
   "id": "xp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 1710,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "reports the paused run to the Owner, with the decision it needs"
  },
  {
   "id": "a6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 1740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**6.** assesses each remaining subfolder's sensitivity"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 1740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: restores the Clerk's qualification (remedy R2)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4240,
   "y": 1740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 escalated to tier 0: a failure of this use case\n*outcome: escalated*",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4240,
   "y": 1910,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 paused for the Owner's decision\n*outcome: paused*",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 1940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 subfolder sensitive?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 2140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**7.** accepts the remaining subfolders by policy, attested as the policy"
  },
  {
   "id": "x1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 2140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "reports the held subfolder to tier 0"
  },
  {
   "id": "a8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 2340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**8.** queues the in-scope documents for each accepted root"
  },
  {
   "id": "x2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 2340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "puts the decision to the Owner"
  },
  {
   "id": "a9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2140,
   "y": 2540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**9.** validates the queued count against the survey"
  },
  {
   "id": "x3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "decides the held subfolder"
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2140,
   "y": 2740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 queued count matches?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 2940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**10.** captures and stages each document"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 2940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: reconciles the queue (remedy R3)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "a11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 3140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**11.** approves the staged documents by policy, attested as the policy"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 3340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25ac for each approved document, in the Clerk pool",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "a12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 3540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**12.** parses and converts each document"
  },
  {
   "id": "a14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 3710,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**14.** enforces the library's spend ceiling"
  },
  {
   "id": "a13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 3740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**13.** reads each document part by part"
  },
  {
   "id": "dc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 3880,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 spend under the ceiling?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "m1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3400,
   "y": 3940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "answers each Clerk task"
  },
  {
   "id": "j1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 4050,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25ac all documents processed",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "x4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 3940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "reports the spend and the work left to tier 0"
  },
  {
   "id": "dm",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3400,
   "y": 4140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 answered in time and in full?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "d5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 4220,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 every document fully read?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "x5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 4140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "puts the budget decision to the Owner"
  },
  {
   "id": "a15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3820,
   "y": 4340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**15.** imports each fully converted paper into the paper graph"
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 4340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: re-reads the partial documents (remedy R4)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "d6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 4540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 library's promotion mode?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 4740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**16.** accepts the enriched documents by policy, attested as the policy"
  },
  {
   "id": "x6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 4910,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "raises 'N documents await acceptance' on the Owner's agenda"
  },
  {
   "id": "a17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 5080,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**17.** writes each Source note and validates it is findable"
  },
  {
   "id": "x7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "accepts the documents"
  },
  {
   "id": "d7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 5250,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 findable by title, bottom line and concept?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 5340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**18.** judges the run against the specification: deterministic checks first, then a model review"
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 5340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: repairs the note's index entry (remedy R5)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "d8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 5540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 specification met?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 5740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**19.** hands the result and the oracle's verdict to tier 0"
  },
  {
   "id": "r6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 5740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u21c9 **UC-D**: applies the catalogued remedy for the shortfall",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "x8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2140,
   "y": 5740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "scouts the shortfall's blast radius, read-only"
  },
  {
   "id": "a20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 5940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**20.** reviews the result once against the specification"
  },
  {
   "id": "x9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 5940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "re-aligns the run with the specification, from the oracle's report and the scouting"
  },
  {
   "id": "d9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 6140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 ready to hand over?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a21",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 6340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**21.** reports the result to the Owner"
  },
  {
   "id": "x10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 6510,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "tasks the oracle with tidy-up instructions"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4240,
   "y": 6540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 the Owner has the result and its report: Source notes findable, labelled, in the graph\n*outcome: success*",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "x11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 6540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "oversees the tidy-up, through the Lead and the doctor"
  },
  {
   "id": "x12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 6740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "applies the oracle's instructions"
  },
  {
   "id": "x13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 6940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "judges again and submits its response to tier 0"
  },
  {
   "id": "x14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 7140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "makes a second, final pass"
  },
